# The panel just opened lands in the narrow sidebar. Move it to the first
# column, give it the column's full height, close the second file manager so
# the column widens, and focus it. (Chords bound in env/config.toml.)
Alt+v
Sleep 400ms
Alt+z
Sleep 400ms
Alt+u
Sleep 300ms
Alt+w
Sleep 600ms
Alt+j
Sleep 600ms
